WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.745
By the end, your own job list Sheet collects jobs for you every morning.

2
00:00:04.745 --> 00:00:05.460
Four steps.

3
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.446
Open my second link, the job list.

4
00:00:09.446 --> 00:00:10.674
Same as before:

5
00:00:10.674 --> 00:00:12.900
click File, then Make a copy.

6
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.540
Give it a name, and click Make a copy.

7
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.788
Your copy opens.

8
00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.680
This is your job list Sheet.

9
00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:30.400
Click the menu Job collector, at the top, then the first line, Set up now.

10
00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.211
Google asks permission again, once for this Sheet.

11
00:00:35.211 --> 00:00:36.381
Same as before:

12
00:00:36.381 --> 00:00:39.380
OK, your account, Advanced, Go to, Allow.

13
00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:43.740
Then click Job collector, Set up now, one more time.

14
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.915
It asks which job list to start with.

15
00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:50.620
Click Yes, for a clean list.

16
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.127
It sets itself to run every morning.

17
00:00:54.127 --> 00:00:56.040
When you see Done, click OK.

18
00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:05.020
Now we connect it to your contractor form Sheet, so it looks for jobs that fit your people.

19
00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:11.900
Click Job collector, then the second line, Connect the contractor list.

20
00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.680
Copy it from the address bar.

21
00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:21.956
Paste the address of your contractor form Sheet, the one from part one.

22
00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:22.500
Click OK.

23
00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.736
When it says Connected, click OK.

24
00:01:26.736 --> 00:01:29.110
It now knows who your people are.

25
00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:32.171
One click only you can do.

26
00:01:32.171 --> 00:01:34.740
Open the tab Talent roles, at the bottom.

27
00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:39.716
Click cell A1, then Allow access.

28
00:01:39.716 --> 00:01:41.960
That lets it read your contractor list.

29
00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:47.040
Then click Job collector, Check again, so it can see the change.

30
00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:53.341
When it says Everything is ready, click OK.

31
00:01:53.341 --> 00:01:56.140
Every line on the Setup tab says OK.

32
00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:58.860
That's part three.

33
00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:03.420
Your job list Sheet is set up, and it knows your contractors.
